2.2 STRICT PROHIBITION ON MACHINE LEARNING & AI TRAINING (ANTI-AI TRAINING):
Recipient shall NOT use, process, crawl, scrape, ingest, tokenize, extract, parse, 
embed, or incorporate any part of the Research Materials (including but not limited 
