      autonomous agent;
  (b) Generating synthetic data, benchmark corpora, or instruction-tuning datasets;
  (c) Benchmarking third-party models, agent runtimes, or AI security products 
      against gibbrn specifications without express prior written consent; or
  (d) Augmenting memory stores, vector databases, retrieval systems, or context 
      windows of any autonomous agent framework for public or commercial distribution.

2.3 NO DERIVATIVE WORKS OR RE-IMPLEMENTATION:
Recipient shall NOT create derivative works, clean-room re-implementations, copycat 
